<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'">
<title>{{ view.title }}</title>
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #f7f5ef;
  --surface: #fffdf8;
  --ink: #1a1915;
  --muted: #5e594f;
  --faint: #6b665b;
  --line: #d9d2c3;
  --line-strong: #b9b09d;
  --bg-muted: #ece8de;
  --accent: #175c46;
  --accent-ink: #0e3b2d;
  --accent-wash: #e4eee8;
  --warn: #7a3e0b;
  --danger: #8a2d2d;
  --font-display: "Iowan Old Style", "Palatino Linotype", "Songti SC", "Noto Serif CJK SC", Georgia, serif;
  --font-sans: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC", "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei", "Noto Sans CJK SC", sans-serif;
  --font-mono: ui-monospace, "SFMono-Regular", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  --text-xs: 12px;
  --text-sm: 13px;
  --text-base: 15px;
  --text-lg: 18px;
  --text-xl: 22px;
  --text-2xl: 32px;
  --text-3xl: 52px;
  --leading-tight: 1.15;
  --leading-base: 1.6;
  --space-1: 4px;
  --space-2: 8px;
  --space-3: 12px;
  --space-4: 16px;
  --space-5: 24px;
  --space-6: 32px;
  --space-7: 48px;
  --space-8: 64px;
  --space-9: 96px;
  --radius-xs: 2px;
  --radius-sm: 4px;
  --shadow-overlay: 0 12px 32px rgba(26, 25, 21, 0.16);
  --motion-fast: 120ms;
  --motion-base: 180ms;
  --width-page: 1080px;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --bg: #12130f;
    --surface: #1a1b16;
    --ink: #f0ede4;
    --muted: #b3aea1;
    --faint: #918c7f;
    --line: #34362d;
    --line-strong: #4b4d41;
    --bg-muted: #20221b;
    --accent: #85c9ad;
    --accent-ink: #d8f0e3;
    --accent-wash: #1d2b24;
    --warn: #e0a458;
    --danger: #f08a8a;
    --shadow-overlay: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); }
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: var(--text-base);
  line-height: var(--leading-base);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}
a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration-thickness: 1px; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
a:hover { color: var(--accent-ink); }
a:focus-visible, summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
.page { width: min(100% - var(--space-6), var(--width-page)); margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--space-6) 0 var(--space-8); }
.masthead {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: var(--space-4);
  padding-bottom: var(--space-3);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.brand { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: var(--space-2); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--text-sm); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.brand__cn { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: var(--text-sm); letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--muted); }
.masthead__meta { font-size: var(--text-xs); color: var(--muted); text-align: right; }
.hero {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.45fr) minmax(220px, 1fr);
  gap: var(--space-7);
  align-items: end;
  padding: var(--space-7) 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.eyebrow { margin: 0 0 var(--space-3); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--text-xs); letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; }
.hero h1 {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: var(--text-3xl);
  line-height: var(--leading-tight);
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}
.hero h1 strong { font-weight: 400; color: var(--accent); }
.lede { max-width: 46ch; margin: var(--space-4) 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: var(--text-sm); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong); }
.stats div { padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-3) 0 0; border-right: 1px solid var(--line); }
.stats div:last-child { border-right: 0; padding-right: 0; }
.stats dt { margin: 0 0 var(--space-1); color: var(--muted); font-size: var(--text-xs); }
.stats dd { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--text-xl); line-height: var(--leading-tight); }
.section { padding: var(--space-7) 0 0; }
.section__head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--space-4); margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }
.section h2 { margin: 0; font-size: var(--text-lg); line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
.section__note { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: var(--text-xs); }
.legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-3); color: var(--muted); font-size: var(--text-xs); }
.legend span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-1); }
.swatch { display: inline-block; width: 18px; height: 6px; border-radius: var(--radius-xs); }
.swatch--busy { background: var(--ink); }
.swatch--focus { background: var(--accent); }
.swatch--fragment { background: var(--line-strong); }
.timeline { display: grid; gap: var(--space-2); margin-top: var(--space-3); }
.day {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 92px minmax(0, 1fr) 190px;
  gap: var(--space-3);
  align-items: center;
  padding: var(--space-2) 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.day:first-child { border-top: 0; }
.day__head { display: flex; flex-direction: column; line-height: 1.3; }
.day__name { font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 600; }
.day__date { font-size: var(--text-xs); color: var(--muted); }
.day__stat { color: var(--muted); font-size: var(--text-xs); text-align: right; }
.track {
  position: relative;
  height: 26px;
  background: var(--bg-muted);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
  overflow: hidden;
}
.segment { position: absolute; top: 0; bottom: 0; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; }
.segment--busy { background: var(--ink); color: var(--bg); }
.segment--focus { background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg); }
.segment--fragment { background: var(--line-strong); color: var(--ink); }
.segment--lunch { background: var(--bg); border-left: 1px solid var(--line); border-right: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--faint); }
.segment__label { display: block; padding: 0 var(--space-1); font-size: var(--text-xs); line-height: 24px; }
.table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: var(--text-sm); }
.table th, .table td { padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-2); text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
.table th { color: var(--muted); font-size: var(--text-xs); font-weight: 500; }
.table td:first-child, .table th:first-child { padding-left: 0; }
.table td:last-child, .table th:last-child { padding-right: 0; text-align: right; }
.table td:last-child { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.table tbody tr:hover { background: var(--bg-muted); transition: background var(--motion-fast) ease-out; }
.suggestions { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong); }
.suggestion { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 44px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--space-3); padding: var(--space-3) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
.suggestion__rank { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--text-xs); color: var(--muted); padding-top: var(--space-1); }
.suggestion__time { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--text-xl); line-height: 1.2; }
.suggestion__time span { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: var(--text-xs); color: var(--muted); margin-left: var(--space-2); }
.suggestion__reason { margin: var(--space-1) 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: var(--text-sm); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.note { margin: var(--space-4) 0 0; padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4); background: var(--accent-wash); border-left: 2px solid var(--accent); color: var(--accent-ink); font-size: var(--text-sm); }
.empty { margin: var(--space-3) 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: var(--text-sm); }
.method { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 150px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--space-2) var(--space-4); margin: 0; font-size: var(--text-sm); }
.method dt { color: var(--muted); }
.method dd { margin: 0; }
.sources { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; font-size: var(--text-sm); }
.sources li { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--space-4); padding: var(--space-2) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
.sources .muted { color: var(--muted); }
.warnings { margin: var(--space-3) 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--warn); }
.warnings li { padding: var(--space-2) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
.details { margin-top: var(--space-4); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
.details summary { cursor: pointer; padding: var(--space-3) 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: var(--text-sm); }
.details summary:hover { color: var(--ink); }
.footer { margin-top: var(--space-8); padding-top: var(--space-3); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--space-4); color: var(--muted); font-size: var(--text-xs); }
.footer span:last-child { text-align: right; }
.muted { color: var(--muted); }
.nowrap { white-space: nowrap; }
@media (max-width: 760px) {
  .page { width: min(100% - var(--space-4), var(--width-page)); padding-top: var(--space-4); }
  .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--space-5); padding: var(--space-6) 0; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: var(--text-2xl); }
  .stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .stats dd { font-size: var(--text-lg); }
  .day { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--space-1); }
  .day__head { flex-direction: row; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; }
  .day__stat { text-align: left; }
  .track { height: 22px; }
  .segment__label { line-height: 20px; }
  .section__head { flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2); }
  .method { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--space-1); }
  .method dt { margin-top: var(--space-2); }
  .table thead { display: none; }
  .table tr { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0 var(--space-3); padding: var(--space-2) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .table td { border: 0; padding: var(--space-1) 0; text-align: left !important; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .table td::before { content: attr(data-label); display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: var(--text-xs); }
  .table td:first-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; font-weight: 600; }
  .footer { flex-direction: column; }
  .footer span:last-child { text-align: left; }
  .suggestion { grid-template-columns: 32px minmax(0, 1fr); }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  * { transition: none !important; }
}
@media print {
  :root { --bg: #ffffff; --surface: #ffffff; --ink: #111111; --muted: #444444; --line: #cccccc; --line-strong: #999999; --bg-muted: #f2f2f2; --accent: #14503d; --accent-ink: #0b2f24; --accent-wash: #eef5f1; }
  .page { width: 100%; }
  .details { display: none; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="page">
  <header class="masthead">
    <div class="brand">Weekglass <span class="brand__cn">周镜</span></div>
    <div class="masthead__meta">{{ view.week_iso }} · {{ view.range_label }}<br>{{ view.timezone }} · 生成于 {{ view.generated }}</div>
  </header>

  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ view.week_iso }} · {{ view.days_label }}</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">完整专注<br><strong>{{ view.metrics.focus }}</strong></h1>
      <p class="lede">{{ view.conclusion }}</p>
    </div>
    <dl class="stats">
      <div><dt>占用</dt><dd>{{ view.metrics.busy }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>碎片空闲</dt><dd>{{ view.metrics.fragmented }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>最长空闲</dt><dd>{{ view.metrics.longest }}</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="week-title">
    <div class="section__head">
      <h2 id="week-title">一周时间带</h2>
      <div class="legend">
        <span><i class="swatch swatch--busy"></i>占用</span>
        <span><i class="swatch swatch--focus"></i>完整专注</span>
        <span><i class="swatch swatch--fragment"></i>碎片</span>
        <span class="muted">{{ view.work_start }}–{{ view.work_end }}，午休 {{ view.lunch }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline">
      {% for day in view.days %}
      <div class="day">
        <div class="day__head"><span class="day__name">{{ day.weekday }}</span><span class="day__date">{{ day.date_label }}</span></div>
        <div class="track" role="img" aria-label="{{ day.weekday }}：占用 {{ day.busy }}，完整专注 {{ day.focus }}">
          {% for segment in day.segments %}
          <span class="segment segment--{{ segment.kind }}" style="left: {{ segment.left }}%; width: {{ segment.width }}%;" title="{{ segment.label }}">{% if segment.label %}<span class="segment__label">{{ segment.label }}</span>{% endif %}</span>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <div class="day__stat">占用 {{ day.busy_pct }} · 专注 {{ day.focus }} · {{ day.focus_blocks }} 块</div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="daily-title">
    <div class="section__head">
      <h2 id="daily-title">按天</h2>
      <p class="section__note">碎片 = 短于 {{ view.min_focus }} 分钟的空闲</p>
    </div>
    <table class="table">
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">日期</th><th scope="col">占用</th><th scope="col">完整专注</th><th scope="col">碎片</th><th scope="col">最长空闲</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
      {% for day in view.days %}
      <tr>
        <td data-label="日期">{{ day.weekday }} · {{ day.date_label }}</td>
        <td data-label="占用">{{ day.busy }}（{{ day.busy_pct }}）</td>
        <td data-label="完整专注">{{ day.focus }} · {{ day.focus_blocks }} 块</td>
        <td data-label="碎片">{{ day.fragmented }} · {{ day.fragments }} 段</td>
        <td data-label="最长空闲">{{ day.longest }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="suggest-title">
    <div class="section__head">
      <h2 id="suggest-title">可以放回日历的专注块</h2>
      {% if view.suggestions %}<p class="section__note">按完整程度和时段排序；每天最多 {{ view.max_per_day }} 个</p>{% endif %}
    </div>
    {% if view.suggestions %}
    <ol class="suggestions">
      {% for suggestion in view.suggestions %}
      <li class="suggestion">
        <span class="suggestion__rank">{{ "%02d"|format(suggestion.rank) }}</span>
        <div>
          <p class="suggestion__time">{{ suggestion.weekday }} {{ suggestion.time }}<span>{{ suggestion.duration }}</span></p>
          <p class="suggestion__reason">{{ suggestion.reason }}（{{ suggestion.date_label }}）</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
    {% if view.plan_file %}
    <p class="note">专注块已写入 <strong>{{ view.plan_file }}</strong>。把它导入日历后，确认与现有安排不冲突再保存。</p>
    {% else %}
    <p class="note">本次没有生成 .ics 文件。运行 <code>weekglass audit … --plan-out focus.ics</code> 可导出这些时间块。</p>
    {% endif %}
    {% else %}
    <p class="empty">这一周没有 ≥ {{ view.min_focus }} 分钟的连续空闲。可以先减少会议、把短会集中到同一天，或调低 <code>--min-focus</code>。</p>
    <p class="note">本次没有生成 .ics 文件。</p>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="method-title">
    <div class="section__head"><h2 id="method-title">怎么算的</h2><p class="section__note">所有时间按 {{ view.timezone }} 计算</p></div>
    <dl class="method">
      <dt>可用时间</dt><dd>工作日 {{ view.work_start }}–{{ view.work_end }}，扣除午休 {{ view.lunch }}；本次{% if view.include_weekend %}包含周末{% else %}不包含周末{% endif %}。</dd>
      <dt>占用</dt><dd>合并重叠事件后，落在可用时间内的时间；前后缓冲 {{ view.buffer }} 分钟{% if view.all_day_busy %}；全天事件按整天占用{% else %}；全天事件不计入占用{% endif %}。</dd>
      <dt>完整专注</dt><dd>连续空闲 ≥ {{ view.min_focus }} 分钟。碎片是短于 {{ view.min_focus }} 分钟的空闲。</dd>
      <dt>碎片率</dt><dd>碎片时间 ÷ 全部空闲时间。没有空闲时记为 0%。</dd>
      <dt>专注建议</dt><dd>从空闲段中按 15 分钟对齐，单块最多 180 分钟（或更长的最短专注设置），再按完整程度、上午和周二至周四加权；默认每天最多 1 个。</dd>
      <dt>重复事件</dt><dd>同一 UID、同一开始和结束、同一标题的事件跨日历合并。本次合并 {{ view.metrics.duplicates }} 个。</dd>
    </dl>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="source-title">
    <div class="section__head"><h2 id="source-title">数据来源</h2><p class="section__note">{{ view.metrics.event_count }} 个事件 · 工时外 {{ view.metrics.after_hours }} · 背靠背 {{ view.metrics.back_to_back }} 对</p></div>
    <ul class="sources">
      {% for source in view.sources %}
      <li><span>{{ source.name }}</span><span class="muted">{{ source.events }} 个事件 · {{ source.bytes }} 字节</span></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% if view.warnings %}
    <ul class="warnings">
      {% for warning in view.warnings %}
      <li>{{ warning.message }}{% if warning.source %}（{{ warning.source }}）{% endif %}</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <details class="details">
    <summary>事件明细（{{ view.metrics.event_count }} 个，点击展开）</summary>
    <table class="table">
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">日期</th><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">来源</th><th scope="col">时间</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
      {% for day in view.days %}
        {% for event in day.events %}
        <tr>
          <td data-label="日期">{{ day.weekday }} {{ day.date_label }}</td>
          <td data-label="事件">{{ event.summary }}{% if event.location %} <span class="muted">· {{ event.location }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
          <td data-label="来源">{{ event.source }}</td>
          <td data-label="时间">{{ event.time }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </details>

  <footer class="footer">
    <span>Weekglass {{ view.version }} · 本地优先的日历审计</span>
    <span>所有计算在本机完成，报告不发起网络请求。<br>事件标题可能包含隐私信息，分享前请先检查。</span>
  </footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
